      "review_summary": "The branch replaces the closure-based canonical proof decision helper in `ChatTranscriptCache.swift` with explicit lock/unlock calls around `cancelCommand` commit and cache cleanup.\n\nPR surface: Other +5. Total +5 across 1 file.\n\nReproducibility: no. runtime reproduction was run in this read-only review. Source inspection shows current main passes actor-isolated SQLite work through a synchronous proof-decision closure, and the PR provides exact-head Swift build/test proof after the refactor.",
